@startuml
title сохранение состояния

actor User
boundary CLI
control PersistenceService
entity UserRepository
entity WalletRepository
database UserFileStore
database WalletFileStore

== Сохранение изменённого состояния ==
User -> CLI: save / logout / exit
CLI -> PersistenceService: saveDirtyState()
PersistenceService -> UserRepository: findDirtyUsers()
UserRepository --> PersistenceService: users
PersistenceService -> WalletRepository: findDirtyWallets()
WalletRepository --> PersistenceService: wallets
PersistenceService -> UserFileStore: saveAtomically(users)
UserFileStore --> PersistenceService: success / error
PersistenceService -> WalletFileStore: saveAtomically(wallets)
WalletFileStore --> PersistenceService: success / error

alt всё сохранено
  PersistenceService -> UserRepository: markClean(users)
  PersistenceService -> WalletRepository: markClean(wallets)
  PersistenceService --> CLI: success
  CLI --> User: данные сохранены
else ошибка записи
  PersistenceService --> CLI: error; state remains dirty in memory
  CLI --> User: данные не сохранены
end

@enduml
